Your rules for this feature, as the builders will follow them (each one applies to every case like it, not just the example):
  1. Whenever a refund works out to an amount with a fraction of a rupee, round it down to the whole rupee in the shop's favour (for example, ₹1,249.50 becomes ₹1,249).
