  3. Whenever a return is for change of mind (not damaged goods), apply the following to every item. Refund the full goods price if the return is requested within 14 days of receiving the order (day 14 included). Refund half of the goods price if it is requested from day 15 to day 30. Refund nothing after day 30. The original shipping fee is never refunded. For example, Meera at day 10, who just did not like the item, gets her full money back.
